Package: hplcAnalyzer
Type: Package
Title: Automated HPLC-UV Analysis and peptide concentration estimation
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Peter", "Kubiniok", email = "peterkubiniok@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Read Agilent .D folders or thermo UV data exports (.txt), perform baseline correction if needed,
    detect peaks, compute concentrations, estimate peptide sequence‐specific ε214 (Kuipers & Gruppen, 2007) molar absorbtion constants and  generateplot results.
